program	df151e_optional_element_repeat_error.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	a repeat literal needs a freely copyable element, and `Handle?` is NoCopy
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: a repeat literal needs a freely copyable element, and `Handle?` is NoCopy"
log	"  --> examples/df151e_optional_element_repeat_error.saw:15:32"
log	"     |"
log	" 15 |     let slots: [Handle?; 4] = [Handle(id: 1); 4]"
log	"     |                                ^"
log	"   hint: a NoCopy value has exactly one owner, so there is nothing to repeat — build the array element by element, moving a separate value into each slot"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
